OL,3,AKenya confirms second Ebola case as
OL,4,Arelative of country's first victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetecting his illness early had
OL,7,Fimproved his chances of recovery and
OL,8,Flimited the chance of him passing the
OL,9,Fvirus on to others, the ministry said,
OL,10,Fas it urged the public to "stay calm
OL,11,Fbut vigilant".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
